id: pm-gantt-chart-olgh
title: Adopt the canonical SDK-certified complete-list reader
description: "Replace the deprecated list-all subprocess with canonical list --all, exact-pin development to pm CLI/SDK 2026.8.21 while proving the 2026.8.20 behavior floor, and make the public SDK own shared complete-corpus certification before Gantt command or export consumes rows."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[5]: agents,cli-ux,completeness,pm-sdk,tdd
created_at: "2026-08-21T08:13:53.373Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-21T08:33:18.620Z"
assignee: codex
claim_principal: codex
author: codex
estimated_minutes: 360
acceptance_criteria: "Production uses pm list --all with JSON, all statuses, full projection, strict-read, no-truncate, and both unbounded controls; public SDK inspection and certification own shared policy while narrow supplemental checks reject the verified pm-cli issue 1078 gaps; malformed, bounded, omitted, unreadable, contradictory, duplicate-ID, and bare-array outputs fail closed; raw manifest compatibility is proven at minimum 2026.8.20 and exact development 2026.8.21; mandatory packed npm/npx current, Bun/bunx current, and npm/npx minimum acceptance exercises real Gantt command and export with no alias diagnostic; README, tests, changelog, release workflow, package PM evidence, CI, review, privacy, and independent coverage blockers are recorded honestly; no merge or publication occurs while pm-gantt-chart-8mkl or pm-gantt-chart-2u8i is open"
reporter: codex
severity: high
environment: Installed pm CLI and SDK 2026.8.21 on clean pm-gantt-chart main 2026.8.18
repro_steps: Run pm gantt from a packed extension or inspect fetchItems in index.ts; production still sends deprecated list-all and hand-maintains the complete-list envelope policy against a 2026.8.17 development SDK.
expected_result: "Every Gantt command and exporter reads the complete tracker through canonical strict full unbounded argv, current public SDK certification, and narrow fail-closed supplements for verified SDK gaps, without alias diagnostics."
actual_result: "Full release:check passes: 174 tests; configured index.ts coverage 100% lines, 100% branches, 100% functions; 55 documented declarations across 4 checked files; zero production vulnerabilities; 9-file tarball; deterministic changelog; packed npm/npx current 2026.8.21, Bun/bunx current 2026.8.21, and npm/npx minimum 2026.8.20 each run a real Gantt command and JSON export over a created tracker fixture with no deprecated alias diagnostic. pm validate reports 72 items with zero history drift, merge reconcile dry-run reports zero pending decisions, and duplicates since 2026-08-21 reports zero. pm health strict is operationally green with three preserved legacy provenance advisories. Privacy/history pm-gantt-chart-8mkl and all-source quality pm-gantt-chart-2u8i remain open, so this branch is not merge or publication ready."
component: whole-tracker reader
customer_impact: Deprecated alias diagnostics pollute agent stderr; duplicated package-owned receipt logic can drift from the host SDK and permit a partial schedule to be presented as complete.
